                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Huyo mwanamke ambaye mwanamume amelala naye kwa shahawa, wote wawili wataoga majini, nao watakuwa najisi hadi jioni.",
          "type": "text",
